tus":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid02uChX33svvLjGTdhLPiwiLyei6eW6yMKa1edBExPLxHAjdkATCJYSXdSTPcZbruel","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1947","post_id":"1947","platform":"instagram","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/Cxan2DBL28J/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-09-20","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1947/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1772","post_id":"1772","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.net/@zuck/post/CxYD81GRqvh","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-09-19","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1772/","text":"Priscilla and I are optimistic about AI helping scientists to cure, prevent or manage all diseases this century. We're starting a new project at CZI to build a virtual cell to predict how every cell in the human body will behave -- healthy or diseased. To do this, we're building one of the largest AI compute clusters in non-profit life sciences. We're hopeful this will help scientists make new discoveries and find new treatments.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.net/@zuck/post/CxYD81GRqvh","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1765","post_id":"1765","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/reel/308410775103036/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-09-19","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1765/","text":"Priscilla and I are optimistic about AI helping scientists to cure, prevent or manage all diseases this century. We're starting a new project at CZI to build a virtual cell to predict how every cell...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/reel/308410775103036/","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1773","post_id":"1773","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.net/@zuck/post/CxWMc87galo","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-09-18","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1773/","text":"Not sure if I think about the Roman Empire too much. I wonder what my daughters Maxima, August and Aurelia think.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.net/@zuck/post/CxWMc87galo","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1774","post_id":"1774","platform":"threads","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.threads.net/@zuck/post/CxMVWgUrNWY","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-09-14","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1774/","text":"At Meta employee Q&A today we discussed the new products we're launching at Connect in a couple of weeks. Looking forward to sharing with all of you soon!","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.threads.net/@zuck/post/CxMVWgUrNWY","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1766","post_id":"1766","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid06JmGSu1HBwF5eSxrvosFkuKVGuLSrEzMS7rKYDhyYqmXH5oSVdSmcKFYaSxPhpjwl","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-09-14","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1766/","text":"Priscilla and I helped create the Breakthrough Prize to celebrate scientists who are pushing the boundaries of life sciences, fundamental physics, and mathematics. This year's winners have made...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid06JmGSu1HBwF5eSxrvosFkuKVGuLSrEzMS7rKYDhyYqmXH5oSVdSmcKFYaSxPhpjwl","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1767","post_id":"1767","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid0SuXGL5ohZ8G49XguqqdbADCNs6L9SikRNH2M9VLwrfM7hKJUfs6zSiSCG3j4Zmphl","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-09-13","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1767/","text":"Today we're starting to roll out WhatsApp Channels globally and adding thousands of new channels that people can follow in WhatsApp. You can find Channels in the new 'Updates' tab.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/pfbid0SuXGL5ohZ8G49XguqqdbADCNs6L9SikRNH2M9VLwrfM7hKJUfs6zSiSCG3j4Zmphl","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1948","post_id":"1948","platform":"instagram","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.instagram.com/p/CwsgvUlLtEn/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2023-09-02","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1948/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false}]